    "custom_liquid_CfEwEJ": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"slider-mobile-gutter page-width page-width-desktop scroll-trigger animate--slide-in satisfaction-section\">\n    <div class=\"img-box\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0649/4653/6587/files/Group_5749.png?v=1730179611\" alt=\"\"/>\n    </div>\n    <p>At Furgenics, we know how much your pets mean to you—that’s why we stand behind our products 100%. Every bottle is a promise of premium quality, and if you or your pet aren’t fully satisfied, we’ve got your back. Our gentle, all natural ingredients are free from parabens, sulfates and harsh chemicals so every wash is a soothing experience.</p>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n        <h5>\n            See What Happy Pups are\n            Saying About our Full Range of Products \n        </h5>\n        <a href=\"/collections/all\" class=\"button\">Leave a Review\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/right-arrow-w.png?v=1728912790\" alt=\"\"></a>\n      </div>\n  <ul class=\"review-list\">\n    <li>\n        <ul class=\"stars\">\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n        </ul>\n        <h5>I love it.</h5>\n        <p>I have a Golden Retriever, so shedding is a part of life. I’ve tried tons of shampoos, but nothing compares to Furgenics! After using their shampoo, Bella’s coat feels softer than ever, and the shedding has gone down noticeably. I also love that the ingredients are natural—no more worrying about harsh chemicals irritating her skin. And the scent? It’s subtle but clean, which is perfect. Bath time just became less of a chore!</p>\n        <p class=\"reviewer\">Sarah B.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <ul class=\"stars\">\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n        </ul>\n        <h5>Incredible</h5>\n        <p>My French Bulldog, Max, has super sensitive skin, and every shampoo I tried before either left him itchy or dry. I’m so glad I found Furgenics! Their shampoo is so gentle, and the anti-itch formula actually works. No more scratching himself all day! Plus, Max smells great afterward without that overpowering fake scent. Knowing the shampoo is eco-friendly is just the icing on the cake—our family is all about sustainability!</p>\n        <p class=\"reviewer\">David M.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <ul class=\"stars\">\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n            <li><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0677/2080/6573/files/star-filled.png?v=1728971486\" alt=\"\"></li>\n        </ul>\n        <h5>Just PAWsome</h5>\n        <p>I started using Furgenics on my Labradoodle, Charlie, and I can honestly say I’ll never go back to store-bought shampoos. His curls are soft, tangle-free, and shiny after every wash. I took him to the groomer last week, and she asked what I’d been using because his coat looked amazing! On top of that, the shampoo rinses out so easily, which makes bath time much quicker (and less stressful for Charlie). Highly recommend!</p>\n        <p class=\"reviewer\">Emma A.</p>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>",
